    "name": "Corrupted Souls",
    "steam_appid": 3768380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupted Souls \u2013 A Souls-like Descent into Betrayal and Flame</strong><br><i>Face the truth they tried to bury\u2026 and awaken the fire they feared.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a knight of the realm\u2014silent, loyal, and forgotten. Betrayed by those you bled for, you were cast into the Monster World: a cursed land where humanity\u2019s sins fester in monstrous form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by creatures born from rage and wisdom, you wander a broken world ruled by the Four Catastrophes\u2014beings chosen by the elder monsters to protect the last fragments of freedom. Each step forward leads you deeper into forgotten tombstones, cryptic truths, and a fate far darker than exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is pain. With every wound, the cursed flame within you grows. When the \u201cBurn\u201d ignites, your silence becomes a scream, your blade becomes ruin, and your body sprouts the wings of vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-Inspired Combat</strong> \u2013 Precise dodges, punishing parries, and deadly blade strikes. Every mistake is paid in blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Burn System</strong> \u2013 Take damage to unleash a demonic form, igniting your sword and awakening black flame wings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat &amp; Spirit Customization</strong> \u2013 Level your attributes, enhance your armor\u2019s spirit, and unlock hidden traits like poison or bleed resistance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Driven Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover the story through tombstones scattered across the world, each revealing the truth of your downfall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Four Catastrophes</strong> \u2013 Defeat the elemental protectors of Forest, Frost, Fire, and Lightning to break the seal back to the human world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements &amp; Cloud Saves</strong> \u2013 Track your journey, and continue your progress on any device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arabic Language Support</strong> \u2013 Full localization for Arabic-speaking players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Commitment</strong> \u2013 Receive regular updates, new areas, and refined content based on player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reclaim your soul\u2026 or become the very monster humanity fears?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corrupted Souls \u2013 A Souls-like Descent into Betrayal and Flame</strong><br><i>Face the truth they tried to bury\u2026 and awaken the fire they feared.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once a knight of the realm\u2014silent, loyal, and forgotten. Betrayed by those you bled for, you were cast into the Monster World: a cursed land where humanity\u2019s sins fester in monstrous form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by creatures born from rage and wisdom, you wander a broken world ruled by the Four Catastrophes\u2014beings chosen by the elder monsters to protect the last fragments of freedom. Each step forward leads you deeper into forgotten tombstones, cryptic truths, and a fate far darker than exile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only weapon is pain. With every wound, the cursed flame within you grows. When the \u201cBurn\u201d ignites, your silence becomes a scream, your blade becomes ruin, and your body sprouts the wings of vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-Inspired Combat</strong> \u2013 Precise dodges, punishing parries, and deadly blade strikes. Every mistake is paid in blood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Burn System</strong> \u2013 Take damage to unleash a demonic form, igniting your sword and awakening black flame wings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat &amp; Spirit Customization</strong> \u2013 Level your attributes, enhance your armor\u2019s spirit, and unlock hidden traits like poison or bleed resistance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Driven Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover the story through tombstones scattered across the world, each revealing the truth of your downfall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Four Catastrophes</strong> \u2013 Defeat the elemental protectors of Forest, Frost, Fire, and Lightning to break the seal back to the human world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements &amp; Cloud Saves</strong> \u2013 Track your journey, and continue your progress on any device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arabic Language Support</strong> \u2013 Full localization for Arabic-speaking players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access Commitment</strong> \u2013 Receive regular updates, new areas, and refined content based on player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you reclaim your soul\u2026 or become the very monster humanity fears?</p>",
    "short_description": "A brutal souls-like through a forgotten realm. Battle relentless monsters, uncover buried truths, and reclaim the soul humanity betrayed.",
